#: app/text.py:13
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hey there! 👋🌈\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to <b>CONQUEER</b> — where queer kings conquer connections! 💪✨\n"
"\n"
"Whether you're ready to:\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode</b> — Casual hookups and wild nights\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode</b> — Find your king or prince\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode</b> — Build your chosen family\n"
"\n"
"Your kingdom awaits! Create your profile and start conquering.\n"
"\n"
"<i>Be bold. Be proud. Be you.</i> 🏳️‍🌈\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Halo! 👋🌈\n"
"\n"
"Selamat datang di <b>CONQUEER</b> — tempat para raja queer menaklukkan "
"koneksi! 💪✨\n"
"\n"
"Apakah kamu siap untuk:\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun</b> — Kencan santai & malam liar\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating</b> — Temukan raja atau pangeranmu\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends</b> — Bangun keluarga pilihanmu\n"
"\n"
"Kerajaanmu menanti! Buat profilmu dan mulai menaklukkan.\n"
"\n"
"<i>Jadilah berani. Jadilah bangga. Jadilah dirimu sendiri.</i> 🏳️‍🌈\n"

#: app/text.py:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"🌈 <b>About CONQUEER</b>\n"
"\n"
"Your platform to conquer the dating scene — built by queer men, for queer"
" men.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Three Modes. Infinite Possibilities:</b>\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode</b> — No strings, just vibes\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode</b> — Find something real\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode</b> — Your queer tribe\n"
"\n"
"<b>Conquer On Your Terms:</b>\n"
"- Choose your role: Top, Bottom, or Verse\n"
"- Filter by age range and hosting\n"
"- Location-based matching\n"
"- Safe, private, and judgment-free\n"
"\n"
"Now go forth and conquer! 👑\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🌈 <b>Tentang CONQUEER</b>\n"
"\n"
"Platformmu untuk menaklukkan dunia kencan — dibuat oleh pria queer, untuk"
" pria queer.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Tiga Mode. Peluang Tanpa Batas:</b>\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun</b> — Tanpa ikatan, hanya kesenangan\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating</b> — Temukan hubungan yang tulus\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends</b> — Komunitas queermu\n"
"\n"
"<b>Taklukkan dengan caramu:</b>\n"
"- Pilih peranmu: Top, Bottom, atau Verse\n"
"- Filter berdasarkan usia dan tempat (hosting)\n"
"- Pencocokan berbasis lokasi\n"
"- Aman, privat, dan bebas penghakiman\n"
"\n"
"Sekarang melangkahlah dan taklukkan! 👑\n"

#: app/text.py:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>CONQUEER Command Center</b> 👑\n"
"\n"
"👤 My Profile — Own your presence\n"
"✉️ Invite Friends — Expand the kingdom\n"
"🎭 Enter Mode — Start conquering\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Pusat Komando CONQUEER</b> 👑\n"
"\n"
"👤 Profil Saya — Tunjukkan pesonamu\n"
"✉️ Undang Teman — Perluas kerajaan\n"
"🎭 Pilih Mode — Mulai menaklukkan\n"

#: app/text.py:63
msgid ""
"\n"
"🎭 <b>Choose Your Conquest</b>\n"
"\n"
"What are you hunting for today?\n"
"\n"
"Pick your mode and start browsing:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🎭 <b>Pilih Penaklukanmu</b>\n"
"\n"
"Apa yang kamu cari hari ini?\n"
"\n"
"Pilih modemu dan mulai mencari:\n"

#: app/text.py:74
msgid ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ready to play?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse hot matches\n"
"📭 - See who wants you\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun Aktif</b>\n"
"\n"
"Siap bersenang-senang?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Jelajahi pasangan menarik\n"
"📭 - Lihat siapa yang menyukaimu\n"
"🎂 - Atur rentang usia\n"
"🏠 - Preferensi tempat (host)\n"
"💤 - Kembali ke menu utama\n"

#: app/text.py:88
msgid ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Looking for something real?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse potential matches\n"
"📭 - See who's interested\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating Aktif</b>\n"
"\n"
"Mencari hubungan yang nyata?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Jelajahi calon pasangan\n"
"📭 - Lihat siapa yang tertarik\n"
"🎂 - Atur rentang usia\n"
"🏠 - Preferensi tempat (host)\n"
"💤 - Kembali ke menu utama\n"

#: app/text.py:102
msgid ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode Active</b>\n"
"\n"
"Building your tribe?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Browse friendly faces\n"
"📭 - See who reached out\n"
"🎂 - Set age range\n"
"🏠 - Set hosting preference\n"
"💤 - Return to main menu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends Aktif</b>\n"
"\n"
"Membangun lingkar pertemanan?\n"
"\n"
"🔍 - Temukan teman baru\n"
"📭 - Lihat pesan masuk\n"
"🎂 - Atur rentang usia\n"
"🏠 - Preferensi tempat (host)\n"
"💤 - Kembali ke menu utama\n"

#: app/text.py:116
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Profile Management</b> 👤\n"
"\n"
"🔄 Recreate profile\n"
"🖼 Change photo\n"
"✍️ Change description\n"
"❌ Disable profile\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Back\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Pengaturan Profil</b> 👤\n"
"\n"
"🔄 Buat ulang profil\n"
"🖼 Ganti foto\n"
"✍️ Ubah deskripsi\n"
"❌ Nonaktifkan profil\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Kembali\n"

#: app/text.py:129
msgid "Unknown command, king. Type /start to get back on track. 👑"
msgstr "Perintah tidak dikenal, raja. Ketik /start untuk kembali ke menu. 👑"

#: app/text.py:134
msgid ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Fun Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Time to play! You're now browsing guys looking for casual hookups and "
"steamy encounters.\n"
"\n"
"Who's ready for you tonight? Let's find out! 🔥\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🍆👅🍑💦 <b>Mode Fun Diaktifkan!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Waktunya bermain! Sekarang kamu menjelajahi pria yang mencari kencan "
"santai dan malam panas.\n"
"\n"
"Siapa yang siap untukmu malam ini? Mari kita lihat! 🔥\n"

#: app/text.py:144
msgid ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Dating Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Looking for something deeper? You're now browsing guys seeking meaningful"
" connections and romance.\n"
"\n"
"Your match might be one swipe away! 💕\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❤️🥂 <b>Mode Dating Diaktifkan!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Mencari yang lebih mendalam? Kamu sedang menjelajahi pria yang mencari "
"cinta dan romansa.\n"
"\n"
"Pasanganmu mungkin tinggal selangkah lagi! 💕\n"

#: app/text.py:154
msgid ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Friends Mode Activated!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Building your tribe! You're now browsing guys looking for genuine "
"friendships and community.\n"
"\n"
"Let's expand your chosen family! 🌈\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"🤝 <b>Mode Friends Diaktifkan!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Membangun komunitasmu! Kamu sedang menjelajahi pria yang mencari "
"persahabatan tulus dan kebersamaan.\n"
"\n"
"Mari perluas lingkaranmu! 🌈\n"

#: app/text.py:164
msgid "Fun"
msgstr "Fun"

#: app/text.py:164
msgid "Dating"
msgstr "Kencan"

#: app/text.py:164
msgid "Friends"
msgstr "Teman"

#: app/text.py:166
msgid "casual hookups and fun"
msgstr "kencan santai dan kesenangan"

#: app/text.py:167
msgid "romantic connections"
msgstr "hubungan romantis"

#: app/text.py:168
msgid "platonic friendships"
msgstr "persahabatan tulus"

#: app/text.py:171
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"{new_icon} <b>Switch to {new_name} Mode?</b>\n"
"\n"
"You're currently in <b>{current_name} mode</b>. Switching to "
"<b>{new_name} mode</b> will show you guys looking for "
"<b>{new_description}</b> instead.\n"
"\n"
"Ready to make the switch?\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"{new_icon} <b>Beralih ke Mode {new_name}?</b>\n"
"\n"
"Kamu saat ini di <b>mode {current_name}</b>. Beralih ke <b>mode "
"{new_name}</b> akan menampilkan pria yang mencari "
"<b>{new_description}</b>.\n"
"\n"
"Siap untuk beralih?\n"

#: app/text.py:186
msgid "Staying put! Back to your current mode. 👍"
msgstr "Tetap di sini! Kembali ke modemu saat ini. 👍"

#: app/text.py:191
msgid ""
"What's your position? 🔥\n"
"\n"
"Top, Bottom, or Verse?"
msgstr ""
"Apa posisimu? 🔥\n"
"\n"
"Top, Bottom, atau Verse?"

#: app/text.py:195
msgid ""
"Who are you looking for? 💕\n"
"\n"
"Top, Bottom, Verse, or All?"
msgstr ""
"Siapa yang kamu cari? 💕\n"
"\n"
"Top, Bottom, Verse, atau Semua?"

#: app/text.py:199
msgid ""
"Show yourself! 📸\n"
"\n"
"Upload up to 3 photos (make it count!)"
msgstr ""
"Tunjukkan dirimu! 📸\n"
"\n"
"Unggah hingga 3 foto terbaikmu!"

#: app/text.py:203
msgid "What should we call you? ✍️"
msgstr "Siapa namamu? ✍️"

#: app/text.py:207
msgid "How old are you, king? 🎂"
msgstr "Berapa usiamu, raja? 🎂"

#: app/text.py:211
msgid "What city do you reign in? 🏙️"
msgstr "Di kota mana kamu tinggal? 🏙️"

#: app/text.py:215
msgid ""
"Tell us about yourself! 📝\n"
"\n"
"What makes you... you? (This is your chance to shine!)"
msgstr ""
"Ceritakan tentang dirimu! 📝\n"
"\n"
"Apa yang membuatmu unik? (Ini kesempatanmu untuk bersinar!)"

#: app/text.py:220
msgid ""
"Can you host? 🏠\n"
"\n"
"(Important for Fun mode!)"
msgstr ""
"Apakah kamu bisa menyediakan tempat (host)? 🏠\n"
"\n"
"(Penting untuk mode Fun!)"

#: app/text.py:225
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Hosting Preference?</b> 🏠\n"
"\n"
"Who do you want to see?\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Preferensi Tempat (Host)?</b> 🏠\n"
"\n"
"Siapa yang ingin kamu lihat?\n"

#: app/text.py:234
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Who do you want to see?</b> 🔍\n"
"\n"
"Select the role preference for your search:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Siapa yang ingin kamu lihat?</b> 🔍\n"
"\n"
"Pilih preferensi peran untuk pencarianmu:\n"

#: app/text.py:242
msgid ""
"👑 <b>Profile created!</b>\n"
"\n"
"You're all set! Time to start conquering. Hit 🎭 to choose your mode!"
msgstr ""
"👑 <b>Profil berhasil dibuat!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Semua siap! Waktunya mulai menaklukkan. Tekan 🎭 untuk memilih modemu!"

#: app/text.py:246
msgid ""
"\n"
"❌ <b>Profile disabled</b>\n"
"\n"
"Your profile is now hidden and some features are unavailable.\n"
"\n"
"Want to come back? Just send /start to reactivate!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"❌ <b>Profil dinonaktifkan</b>\n"
"\n"
"Profilmu sekarang disembunyikan dan beberapa fitur tidak tersedia.\n"
"\n"
"Ingin kembali? Cukup kirim /start untuk mengaktifkannya lagi!\n"

#: app/text.py:256
msgid ""
"✅ <b>Welcome back, king!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Your profile is active again. Let's conquer! 👑"
msgstr ""
"✅ <b>Selamat datang kembali, raja!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Profilmu aktif kembali. Mari menaklukkan! 👑"

#: app/text.py:260
msgid "🔍 <b>Searching for matches...</b>"
msgstr "🔍 <b>Mencari pasangan...</b>"

#: app/text.py:264
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"📬 <b>{} guys liked your profile!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Let's see who they are:"
msgstr ""
"📬 <b>{} pria menyukai profilmu!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Mari kita lihat siapa mereka:"

#: app/text.py:269
msgid ""
"No matches found in this mode. Try adjusting your filters or check back "
"later! 🌍"
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada profil ditemukan di mode ini. Coba sesuaikan filter atau cek "
"lagi nanti! 🌍"

#: app/text.py:273
msgid ""
"🍆 <b>No more profiles in Fun mode!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Try changing your age/hosting filters or check back later for fresh meat!"
" 🔥"
msgstr ""
"🍆 <b>Tidak ada profil lagi di mode Fun!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Coba ubah filter usia/tempat atau periksa kembali nanti! 🔥"

#: app/text.py:275
msgid ""
"❤️ <b>No more profiles in Dating mode!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Adjust your filters or come back soon — your match might be just around "
"the corner! 💕"
msgstr ""
"❤️ <b>Tidak ada profil lagi di mode Dating!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Sesuaikan filtermu atau kembali segera — pasanganmu mungkin sudah dekat! 💕"

#: app/text.py:277
msgid ""
"🤝 <b>No more profiles in Friends mode!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Tweak your filters or check back later to grow your tribe! 🌈"
msgstr ""
"🤝 <b>Tidak ada profil lagi di mode Friends!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Ubah filtermu atau cek lagi nanti untuk menambah teman! 🌈"

#: app/text.py:278
msgid ""
"😔 <b>No more profiles right now!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Adjust your filters (age/hosting) or try again later!"
msgstr ""
"😔 <b>Profil sudah habis untuk saat ini!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Sesuaikan filter (usia/tempat) atau coba lagi nanti!"

#: app/text.py:282
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"🔥 <b>You got {} likes!</b>\n"
"\n"
"📭 Tap to see who's interested"
msgstr ""
"🔥 <b>Kamu mendapatkan {} suka!</b>\n"
"\n"
"📭 Ketuk untuk melihat siapa yang tertarik"

#: app/text.py:289
msgid "🍆 No one's crushed on you in Fun mode yet... but the night is young! 🔥"
msgstr "🍆 Belum ada yang menyukaimu di mode Fun... tapi malam masih panjang! 🔥"

#: app/text.py:291
msgid ""
"❤️ No one's swiped right in Dating mode yet... but your person is out "
"there! 💕"
msgstr ""
"❤️ Belum ada yang cocok di mode Dating... tapi orang yang tepat ada di "
"luar sana! 💕"

#: app/text.py:293
msgid "🤝 No friend requests in Friends mode yet... but your tribe is forming! 🌈"
msgstr ""
"🤝 Belum ada permintaan pertemanan di mode Friends... komunitasmu sedang "
"terbentuk! 🌈"

#: app/text.py:294
msgid "📭 Your inbox is empty... for now! Keep conquering! 👑"
msgstr "📭 Kotak masukmu kosong... untuk saat ini! Teruslah menaklukkan! 👑"

#: app/text.py:298
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"🎉 <b>It's a match!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Go conquer together: <a href='{}'>{}</a>"
msgstr ""
"🎉 <b>Kalian cocok!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Taklukkan bersama: <a href='{}'>{}</a>"

#: app/text.py:304
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"💌 <b>Message for you:</b>\n"
"\n"
"{}"
msgstr ""
"💌 <b>Pesan untukmu:</b>\n"
"\n"
"{}"

#: app/text.py:309
msgid ""
"✉️ <b>Send a message</b> (up to 250 characters)\n"
"\n"
"Make it count! Or skip with the button below."
msgstr ""
"✉️ <b>Kirim pesan</b> (hingga 250 karakter)\n"
"\n"
"Buat berkesan! Atau lewati dengan tombol di bawah."

#: app/text.py:314
msgid "✅ Message sent! Now we wait... 🤞"
msgstr "✅ Pesan terkirim! Sekarang kita tunggu... 🤞"

#: app/text.py:318
msgid "⚠️ Message too long! Keep it under 250 characters."
msgstr "⚠️ Pesan terlalu panjang! Maksimal 250 karakter."

#: app/text.py:322
msgid "❌ Message cancelled. Moving on!"
msgstr "❌ Pesan dibatalkan. Lanjut!"

#: app/text.py:327
msgid "⚠️ Invalid choice. Use the keyboard or type correctly! 📝"
msgstr "⚠️ Pilihan tidak valid. Gunakan keyboard atau ketik dengan benar! 📝"

#: app/text.py:331
msgid "⚠️ Too long! Shorten your message. ✂️"
msgstr "⚠️ Terlalu panjang! Persingkat pesanmu. ✂️"

#: app/text.py:335
msgid "🌍 City not found. Try again with a different spelling!"
msgstr "🌍 Kota tidak ditemukan. Coba lagi dengan ejaan yang berbeda!"

#: app/text.py:339
msgid "⚠️ Invalid photo format! Please upload a proper image. 🖼️"
msgstr "⚠️ Format foto tidak valid! Harap unggah gambar yang benar. 🖼️"

#: app/text.py:343
msgid "⚠️ Age must be a number! 🔢"
msgstr "⚠️ Usia harus berupa angka! 🔢"

#: app/text.py:348
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"📢 <b>Spread the word!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Invited users: <b>{}</b>\n"
"\n"
"Your invite link:\n"
"<code>{}</code>\n"
"\n"
"Help grow the kingdom! 👑"
msgstr ""
"📢 <b>Sebarkan kabar baik!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Pengguna yang diundang: <b>{}</b>\n"
"\n"
"Tautan undanganmu:\n"
"<code>{}</code>\n"
"\n"
"Bantu perbesar kerajaan! 👑"

#: app/text.py:353
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"📺 <b>Our channel:</b>\n"
"{}"
msgstr ""
"📺 <b>Saluran kami:</b>\n"
"{}"

#: app/text.py:358
msgid "🌐 <b>Choose your language:</b>"
msgstr "🌐 <b>Pilih bahasamu:</b>"

#: app/text.py:361
msgid "✅ Language changed!"
msgstr "✅ Bahasa berhasil diubah!"

#: app/text.py:365
msgid "Please select a valid option."
msgstr "Silakan pilih opsi yang valid."

#: app/text.py:369
msgid "Please select a mode first: /fun, /dates, or /friends"
msgstr "Pilih mode terlebih dahulu: /fun, /dates, atau /friends"

#: app/text.py:373
msgid "Error activating mode. Please try again."
msgstr "Gagal mengaktifkan mode. Silakan coba lagi."

#: app/text.py:377
msgid "Unsupported language"
msgstr "Bahasa tidak didukung"

#: app/text.py:381
msgid "Create a profile before searching."
msgstr "Buat profil sebelum mencari pasangan."

#: app/text.py:386
msgid ""
"\n"
"⚠️ <b>Report this profile:</b>\n"
"\n"
"Select a reason:\n"
"🔞 Inappropriate content\n"
"💰 Spam/Advertising\n"
"🔫 Other violation\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Cancel\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"⚠️ <b>Laporkan profil ini:</b>\n"
"\n"
"Pilih alasan:\n"
"🔞 Konten tidak pantas\n"
"💰 Spam / Iklan\n"
"🔫 Pelanggaran lain\n"
"\n"
"↩️ Batal\n"

#: app/text.py:410
msgid ""
"✅ <b>Report submitted!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for keeping CONQUEER safe. We'll review this."
msgstr ""
"✅ <b>Laporan terkirim!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Terima kasih telah menjaga CONQUEER tetap aman. Kami akan meninjaunya."

#: app/text.py:415
msgid ""
"📸 <b>Upload new photos!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Send up to 3 photos to update your profile."
msgstr ""
"📸 <b>Unggah foto baru!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Kirim hingga 3 foto untuk memperbarui profilmu."

#: app/text.py:419
